    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:5b42b65b7a285ec218d1bb7a",
      "kind": "story",
      "source_language": "zh-CN",
      "source_text": "或许这就是训练员提议参加重赏比赛的理由。\n但是必须有实力才能实现“MC参赛计划”。\n现在的我远远不足。",
      "source_fingerprint": "866c92dbf181c7f6ebd74b578904fad5e2fca4fa3688873792eb7e45aee2f1bc",
      "source_repo": "Hachimi-Hachimi/tl-zh-cn",
      "source_commit": "67f8551f77807292cebd2b20b2c752b652393835",
      "source_path": "assets/story/data/50/1084/storytimeline_501084421.json",
