    {
      "uid": "zhcn:26f0a19b785073e8b5ce3d48",
      "kind": "story",
      "source_language": "zh-CN",
      "source_text": "我称霸神赞纪念，让观众陷入沉醉。\n如果要实现“MC参赛计划”，\n接着得参加“NHK英里C”，然而──",
      "source_fingerprint": "f281aabb53a6341ac8683b2dbcaeafe269f026dd700980b99471647aa3ac1506",
      "source_repo": "Hachimi-Hachimi/tl-zh-cn",
      "source_commit": "67f8551f77807292cebd2b20b2c752b652393835",
      "source_path": "assets/story/data/50/1084/storytimeline_501084422.json",
      "json_path": [
        "text_block_list",
