    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:1ad69625c7f2755e8bbd7312",
      "kind": "story",
      "source_language": "zh-CN",
      "source_text": "那么就要在“NHK英里C”前参加“皋月赏”！\n你们以为我是什么人？\n我是谷野美酒──破坏常理的存在！",
      "source_fingerprint": "bd0f74082f3f3672479dff3463184cd7b928fa90335bd60465bb437167a4f8da",
      "source_repo": "Hachimi-Hachimi/tl-zh-cn",
      "source_commit": "67f8551f77807292cebd2b20b2c752b652393835",
      "source_path": "assets/story/data/50/1084/storytimeline_501084422.json",
      "json_path": [
        "text_block_list",
